  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Pixel Tip Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" role=\"main\">\n    <h1 class=\"title\">Pixel Tip</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"bill\">Bill amount ($)</label>\n      <input id=\"bill\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.01\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"0.00\" value=\"\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <fieldset class=\"field tip-group\">\n      <legend>Tip percent</legend>\n      <div class=\"tip-buttons\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Tip percentage options\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"10\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"15\" aria-pressed=\"false\">15%</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"tip-btn\" data-tip=\"20\" aria-pressed=\"false\">20%</button>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"people\">Number of people</label>\n      <input id=\"people\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\" placeholder=\"1\" value=\"1\" />\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"results\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span class=\"result-label\">Tip total</span>\n        <span class=\"result-value\" id=\"tipTotal\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"result-row\">\n        <span class=\"result-label\">Total per person</span>\n        <span class=\"result-value highlight\" id=\"totalPerPerson\">$0.00</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --accent-2: #0f3460;\n  --text: #f1f1f1;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n  --focus: #ffd166;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background-color: var(--bg);\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%, transparent 75%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 75%);\n  background-size: 24px 24px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 12px 12px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent-2);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.title {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.field label,\n.field legend {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"] {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-2);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]:focus {\n  border-color: var(--focus);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.3);\n}\n\ninput[type=\"number\"]::placeholder {\n  color: #555566;\n}\n\n.tip-buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--accent-2);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-2);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:hover {\n  background: #1a4a7a;\n  border-color: var(--focus);\n}\n\n.tip-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.tip-btn:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n}\n\n.tip-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"] {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.results {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding-top: 18px;\n  border-top: 3px dashed var(--accent-2);\n}\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.result-value {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.result-value.highlight {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n  }\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  var billInput = document.getElementById(\"bill\");\n  var peopleInput = document.getElementById(\"people\");\n  var tipTotalEl = document.getElementById(\"tipTotal\");\n  var totalPerPersonEl = document.getElementById(\"totalPerPerson\");\n  var tipButtons = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\".tip-btn\"));\n\n  var selectedTip = 0;\n\n  function formatCurrency(value) {\n    return \"$\" + value.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function calculate() {\n    var bill = parseFloat(billInput.value);\n    var people = parseInt(peopleInput.value, 10);\n\n    if (isNaN(bill) || bill < 0) bill = 0;\n    if (isNaN(people) || people < 1) people = 1;\n\n    var tip = bill * (selectedTip / 100);\n    var totalPerPerson = (bill + tip) / people;\n\n    tipTotalEl.textContent = formatCurrency(tip);\n    totalPerPersonEl.textContent = formatCurrency(totalPerPerson);\n  }\n\n  function selectTip(button) {\n    tipButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", \"false\");\n    });\n    button.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", \"true\");\n    selectedTip = parseFloat(button.getAttribute(\"data-tip\")) || 0;\n    calculate();\n  }\n\n  tipButtons.forEach(function (button) {\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      selectTip(button);\n    });\n  });\n\n  billInput.addEventListener(\"input\", calculate);\n  peopleInput.addEventListener(\"input\", calculate);\n\n  calculate();\n})();\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Tip Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-art styled tip calculator that runs entirely offline in the browser.\n\n## Features\n\n- Enter a bill amount and number of people.\n- Choose a tip percentage (10%, 15%, 20%) via accessible toggle buttons.\n- Instantly see the total tip and the total per person.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n- Keyboard-accessible controls with visible focus, hover, and pressed states.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Type the bill amount into the first field.\n3. Click a tip percent button (or use Tab + Enter/Space to select).\n4. Adjust the number of people if needed.\n5. The results update automatically.\n\nNo network requests, external assets, or build steps are required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup\n- `styles.css` — pixel-art styling\n- `script.js` — calculation logic\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
}